                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>hāḏa bagal, naḏbaḥ fī-h il-laḥam, il-laḥam naḏbaḥ-a, nḥaṭṭū-h il-laḥam, nḥaṭṭū-h maʕa, maʕa l-laḥam hāḏa li ḏibaḥna ḏ-ḏibīḥa nḥaṭṭ-a maʕā-h zayyinna ḏ-ḏibīḥa.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
